  "ingredients": [
    "3 tablespoons sweet butter",
    "2 tablespoons olive oil",
    "2 cups heavy whipping cream",
    "2 cloves garlic, minced",
    "0.25 teaspoon ground white pepper",
    "0.5 cup grated Parmesan cheese",
    "0.75 cup shredded mozzarella cheese",
    "1 (12 ounce) package angel hair pasta"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/KD8LVhYScqrHVcsenARtuVgjboU=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-237995-better-than-olive-garden-alfredo-sauce-DDMFS-step-01-40c797599d794b918c590866c4ebc14f.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/237995/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Melt butter and olive oil in a saucepan over medium-low heat. Add cream, garlic, and white pepper; bring to just under a boil. Reduce heat and simmer, stirring often, until mixture is slightly reduced, about 5 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/7E2KBu0dERAVYmwatKxbZBslWvU=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-237995-better-than-olive-garden-alfredo-sauce-DDMFS-step-02-99130a35db13457798b89301eaff0ea9.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/237995/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Stir Parmesan cheese into cream mixture; simmer until sauce is thickened and smooth, 8 to 10 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/JSvDXSi_H6xoRh0BOZW9m3OAou8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-237995-better-than-olive-garden-alfredo-sauce-DDMFS-step-03-f7fc8f53816446888aa44ddcd579a142.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/237995/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add mozzarella cheese; cook and stir until melted, about 5 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Rhq-kjppETI_OOR1J1CcupyPp7U=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-237995-better-than-olive-garden-alfredo-sauce-DDMFS-step-04-49becacd216d4dbe8e7536d7f371046c.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/237995/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "While the sauce is cooking, bring a large pot of lightly salted water to a boil. Add pasta; cook, stirring occasionally, until cooked through but firm to the bite, 3 to 5 minutes. Drain pasta and transfer to serving plates. Spoon sauce over top and serve immediately.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/rEgTqYQtCwmwlPUuLs1O3wsE4cg=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/237995-betterthanolivegardenalfredo-cd-3174-2000-76f9532e066446dd9deeb4bd75720798.jpg"
      ],
